The '''Empty Bank''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Village Plaza}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on the {{zone|Bank}}.

== Features ==
The '''Empty Bank''' features a few attractions.

===Barter Bank Show=== 
{{Main|Barter Bank Show}}
Whilst on the [[Alpha Hypixel Network]], the '''Empty Bank''' hosted the {{zone|Barter Bank Show}}, which involved a currency called {{Yellow|NotCoins}} and selecting chests.

===Hologram=== 
In the basement of the '''Empty Bank''' is a hologram, located in the center of the room, and floating in the air. It reads:
{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|
$[c]&c&lTHERE'S NOTHING HERE!
$[c]&fWhere did all the &6coins&f go?}}}}
